WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
 

00:00:03.949 --> 00:00:06.819
While humans tend to think of themselves as the

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:11.320
smartest creatures on Earth, the animals in this video prove that sometimes we need a

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:15.910
little help from the other members of the Food Chain. From Man's best friend to the King of the Jungle,

00:00:16.039 --> 00:00:18.039
prepare to be blown away by some

00:00:18.109 --> 00:00:20.588
unbelievable animals that saved people's lives.

00:00:21.349 --> 00:00:24.399
"Kahn To the Rescue": An average day in the backyard

00:00:24.739 --> 00:00:31.749
nearly turned Into a nightmare for this Australian family. Only days after being introduced to his new home, Kahn,

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:34.899
a Doberman Pinscher, managed to save the life of 17

00:00:34.899 --> 00:00:39.699
month-old Charlotte. The two were playing in the backyard when the pooch noticed a King Brown snake;

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:41.870
one of the world's deadliest

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:43.610
hiding underneath the house.

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:47.589
Sensing the danger, the dog quickly grabbed the child by the diaper and tossed it to safety.

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:52.030
For his heroic actions, Kahn received a bite on the paw. Luckily for him,

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:57.610
Charlotte's mother witnessed the entire incident and managed to rush the unlikely hero to the hospital in the nick of time.

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:03.669
"Dory The Rabbit":  Not many people can claim to have had their life saved by a rabbit.

00:01:03.979 --> 00:01:10.809
However, this Englishman has probably told his story enough times to make up for it. Simon Steggall, a lifelong diabetic, fell

00:01:10.810 --> 00:01:12.810
into a coma while watching television.

00:01:13.189 --> 00:01:15.218
Within moments, his pet rabbit, Dory,

00:01:15.219 --> 00:01:18.998
was jumping up and down on his chest in an attempt to wake him up. The animal's

00:01:19.130 --> 00:01:23.439
peculiar behavior was enough to draw the attention of Stegall's wife, who quickly called the paramedics.

00:01:24.259 --> 00:01:27.159
"Porpoises Save A Familiar Face": Film and television

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:33.399
actor, Dick van Dyke, revealed on The Craig Ferguson Show that in his younger years, a group of porpoises had managed to save

00:01:33.399 --> 00:01:40.629
his life in an unlikely way. While lounging on a surfboard, van Dyke dozed off, only to wake up so far out, he could

00:01:40.630 --> 00:01:46.479
no longer see the shore. As he began to paddle with the swells, he noticed a number of fins coming closer and closer...

00:01:46.999 --> 00:01:51.879
Thankfully for him, and all of his fans, the fins turned out to be attached to a group of helpful

00:01:52.039 --> 00:01:58.509
porpoises, which pushed the actor to safety. "Binti The Gorilla": A fun day at the zoo nearly turned deadly after a

00:01:58.759 --> 00:02:00.759
three-year-old boy fell 18 feet

00:02:00.759 --> 00:02:06.818
into a gorilla pit while visiting with his family. As the boy's mother rushed to the scene,  she noticed that some of the gorillas were

00:02:06.819 --> 00:02:09.189
beginning to take an interest in their new pen mate.

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:15.369
That's when something shocking occurred! Binti, a 7-year-old female, picked the boy up and carried him

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:19.570
to the other side of the pit where zoo officials would have a better chance of retrieving him.

00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:27.820
A miraculous feat for any animal, Binti's actions more than likely saved the boy's life from some of the more aggressive gorillas. "Saved By Lions":

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:33.010
While they have been defined more often than not for their ability to tear through flesh,

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:39.399
this particular pack of lions decided to abstain from their usual habits to save the life of a 12-year-old Ethiopian girl.

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:42.729
After being kidnapped by four men on her way home from school,

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:43.780
the girl

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:48.550
was saved when three lions chased away her abductors and stood guard until the police arrived.

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:55.510
One expert believes the pride may have mistaken the cries of the young girl for those of a lion cub, thus explaining why

00:02:55.510 --> 00:03:00.879
they spared her life. Either way, the police may want to consider hiring the furry beasts as consultants.

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:04.359
"Kerry The Horse": It was just another day for

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:09.309
farmer, Fiona Boyd when she had to rely on the wits of her horse to survive a dangerous situation.

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:15.280
Fiona was attempting to move a cow and its calf from one spot to another, when the mother began to attack her.

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:21.429
Lying on the ground and fearing for her life, Fiona was saved by her horse, Kerry Gold. The creature had

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:26.950
been observing the situation and rushed to the aid of her owner. Kicking away the cow, Kerry did enough to allow her

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:28.950
owner to escape in the nick of time.

00:03:29.209 --> 00:03:33.939
"Kilo The Pitbull": When a man posing as a FedEx driver attempted to push his way

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:36.520
into their Staten Island home, Justin Becker

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:42.520
and his dog Kilo sprang into action. As Becker slammed the intruder against the door, Kilo lunged at him, biting

00:03:42.709 --> 00:03:47.859
ferociously. In a state of panic, the man shot the heroic Pitbull before running away. After rushing

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:53.499
into the hospital, it was determined that the wound wasn't serious, allowing Kilo to return home a hero.

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:57.610
"Dolphin Heroes": While swimming in the ocean with his daughter and two

00:03:57.610 --> 00:04:02.679
of her friends, Rob House noticed something peculiar: a group of dolphins had begun to surround them...

00:04:02.959 --> 00:04:06.249
Initially confused, House quickly realized that the dolphins

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:11.380
were attempting to herd him and his companions away from a 10-foot Great White shark swimming nearby.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:15.399
The dolphins continued to protect the group for 40 minutes, only

00:04:15.739 --> 00:04:20.739
dispersing after the enormous predator began to retreat. The ability of the finned creatures to sense danger

00:04:20.739 --> 00:04:23.529
allowed this group of swimmers to escape unharmed.

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:29.030
"Winnie The Cat Sniffs Out Danger": After being woken up in the middle of the night by her cat,

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:32.179
Winnie, Cathy Keesling quickly sensed that something

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:35.930
was wrong. A water pump had broken while she and the rest of her family

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:43.190
were sleeping, causing poisonous carbon monoxide to fill their home. Her husband and son unconscious, Cathy immediately called 911.

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:49.400
Luckily for The Keeslings,  their cat, Winnie, noticed the change in the air and didn't waste any time alerting them to the danger.

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:56.269
"Mandy The Goat": When 78-year-old farmer, Noel Osborne fell Into a pile of manure, it was anything but funny.

00:04:56.430 --> 00:05:01.760
The fall broke his hip, rendering him completely immobile. For the next five days, Noel

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:03.690
was kept alive by his goat Mandy.

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:07.640
She would allow him to drink her milk and would lie beside him at night to keep him

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:13.580
warm. While Noel would make a full recovery after being rescued by friends, he owes a debt of gratitude to Mandy and her

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:15.270
heroic actions.

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:21.080
Have you ever been saved by an animal? Tell us about it in the comment section and don't forget to subscribe to The Things!

